  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationForCorporateBondsIncludedInAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※９　「有価証券」中の社債のうち、有価証券の私募（金融商品取引法第２条第３項）による社債に対する保証債務の額&lt;/p&gt;
